WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.148
I was spying on the pirates’ meeting through a musket hole.

2
00:00:04.149 --> 00:00:07.841
"They have a knife and a book," I said.

3
00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:12.207
The group started walking back to the house. "Here they come."

4
00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:17.198
"Let them come, lad," Long John Silver said cheerily.

5
00:00:17.199 --> 00:00:21.434
The five men came in and pushed one man forward.

6
00:00:21.435 --> 00:00:27.734
"Hand it over, lad," Long John cried. "I know the rules."

7
00:00:27.735 --> 00:00:31.298
The pirate passed something into Long John’s hand.

8
00:00:31.299 --> 00:00:37.243
"The black spot! I thought so," he said, looking down.

9
00:00:37.244 --> 00:00:47.084
"Where did you get the paper? Don’t tell me you’ve cut this piece out of a Bible. What fool would cut up a Bible?"

10
00:00:47.085 --> 00:00:55.585
"I told you swabs," yelled Tom Morgan, "we shouldn’t use a Bible! Nothing good will come of doing

